{"v":15,"id":"a03","kid":"alex","title":"At School","zh":"在学校","level":"1","genre":"学校","src":"original","sum":"小作者介绍自己的学校：教室在二楼，好朋友本和他坐同桌，最喜欢美术课，课间跳绳打球，格林老师又和蔼又有趣。","words":94,"paras":[{"t":"I go to school from Monday to Friday. My school is big and new. My classroom is on the second floor.","w":[[0,1,"i",-1],[2,4,"go",-1],[5,7,"to",-1],[8,14,"school",-1],[15,19,"from",0],[20,26,"monday",0],[27,29,"to",0],[30,36,"friday",0],[38,40,"my",-1],[41,47,"school",-1],[48,50,"is",-1],[51,54,"big",-1],[55,58,"and",-1],[59,62,"new",-1],[64,66,"my",-1],[67,76,"classroom",-1],[77,79,"is",-1],[80,82,"on",-1],[83,86,"the",-1],[87,93,"second",1],[94,99,"floor",1]]},{"t":"I have a good friend at school. His name is Ben. We sit together. In English class, we sing songs and read stories. In art class, we draw pictures. I like art best.","w":[[0,1,"i",-1],[2,6,"have",-1],[7,8,"a",-1],[9,13,"good",-1],[14,20,"friend",-1],[21,23,"at",-1],[24,30,"school",-1],[32,35,"his",-1],[36,40,"name",-1],[41,43,"is",-1],[44,47,"Ben",-1],[49,51,"we",-1],[52,55,"sit",-1],[56,64,"together",-1],[66,68,"in",-1],[69,76,"english",-1],[77,82,"class",-1],[84,86,"we",-1],[87,91,"sing",-1],[92,97,"songs",-1],[98,101,"and",-1],[102,106,"read",-1],[107,114,"stories",-1],[116,118,"in",-1],[119,122,"art",-1],[123,128,"class",-1],[130,132,"we",-1],[133,137,"draw",-1],[138,146,"pictures",-1],[148,149,"i",-1],[150,154,"like",-1],[155,158,"art",-1],[159,163,"best",-1]]},{"t":"At ten o'clock, we go out and play. We jump rope and play ball. Then the bell rings, and we go back to class.","w":[[0,2,"at",-1],[3,6,"ten",-1],[7,14,"o'clock",-1],[16,18,"we",-1],[19,21,"go",-1],[22,25,"out",-1],[26,29,"and",-1],[30,34,"play",-1],[36,38,"we",-1],[39,43,"jump",2],[44,48,"rope",2],[49,52,"and",-1],[53,57,"play",-1],[58,62,"ball",-1],[64,68,"then",-1],[69,72,"the",-1],[73,77,"bell",-1],[78,83,"rings",-1],[85,88,"and",-1],[89,91,"we",-1],[92,94,"go",4],[95,99,"back",4],[100,102,"to",4],[103,108,"class",-1]]},{"t":"My teacher is Mis